; AlifeTactics faction flavor - the chance a faction's stalker carries each behavior. Paired with
; gamedata/scripts/at_faction.script. Section = faction, key = the decision, value = 0..1.
; Lookup: [<faction>] key, else [default] key, else 1 (carries it). The answer is rolled once per
; NPC per key and held for the fight; 0 and 1 never roll. Zombied carry 0 on everything - this
; file is also the zombied participation filter.

